00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.874 size:81% position:41%
And then a volley was,

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Serve the pizza!
Serve the pizza!"

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he would just shout at me
from across the court.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.547
"Serve the pizza! Run! Olé!"

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:24.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like --
It was really --

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:26.619
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.588
-This is --
-I just wanted to do her proud.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You just wanted
to do her proud.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:31.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
